## Suggested Use Order

1. Need the normal handoff gate: run `[VERIFY_COMMAND]`.
2. Need one narrow behavior check: run the smallest focused command listed above.
3. Need setup or local runtime behavior: use the exact install/run/package commands listed above.
4. Need deeper semantics for why a command matters: open `docs/ENGINEERING_PLAYBOOK.md` or the project runbook.